<title>INDIA: India Great Eastern falls on results.</title>
<headline>India Great Eastern falls on results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Great Eastern Shipping Company Ltd fell on the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) on Wednesday following poor first half results announced by the firm on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Great Eastern's share fell 1.25 rupees or 4.7 percent to 28 on the BSE in early trade. The share fell by 0.95 rupees to 28.05 on the National Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The firm, India's leading private shipping company, said its net profit for the first half of 1996/97 (April-March) fell to 594.8 million rupees, compared with 737 million rupees during the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
